1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,660
Summary rolls your open positions up, one row per instrument and side.

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:07,910
To find an instrument quickly, type in the search box.

3
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:11,270
Only matching rows stay. Clear the box to see them all again.

4
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:14,320
The red Close button closes every position in that instrument, Buy and Sell.

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:20,900
You are asked to confirm, with the instrument named.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,270
Both EURUSD positions are now closed.

7
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:28,700
Events and Messages logs what happened. Click an entry to read it in full below.

8
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:31,750
Click a column heading to sort the log by that column.

